Error [jet.InvalidEmbedPath]: `embed_bytes` path `/etc/passwd` must be relative
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_bytes_computed_absolute.jet:2:15
    |
  2 | D: comptime { embed_bytes("{ROOT}/passwd") }
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: An absolute path reaches outside the project, and this one was computed at build time
 Fix: Compute a path relative to this file's own directory
